Package: vn-demo-detector
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OTP_Provisioner demo <demo@localhost>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, systemd
X-Sandbox-Permissions: demo.frames.read, demo.detections.report
Description: untrusted half of the OTP_Provisioner sandboxed-app demo
 An ordinary Debian package with its own system user and systemd units. It
 reads the frames of the trusted provider (io.github.DetectInt.Demo) through
 the read-only shared memory handle it gets over D-Bus, finds the bright blob
 and reports where it is, five times a second. A second unit checks once at
 start what its sandbox lets through.
